Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.70,Hook,,0,0,0,,ME MAREA SALIR DE CASA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Te lo juro, estoy mareado,\Neh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Es normal que me maree\Nsalir de casa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿O será el calor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:11.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me marea. Me marea salir\Nde casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ya es la segunda vez que\Nme pasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:18.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Se acuerdan de la vez que\Nfui por unos jeans?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:24.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Y les dije: qué horrible\Nexperiencia, que no se\Nrepita.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me fui a levantar, a por\Njeans…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Igual me dio dolor de\Ncabeza. Me mareé.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:34.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No estoy hecho pa' salir\Nde casa.
